391 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 755 0 R
/E (Our analysis shows that the Qwen3 embedding space is often driven more by syntax, urls, and airlines than by the actual meaning of the text. While the model is robust to small lexical changes, it becomes more unstable when sentence structure or context is modified. Our visual framework helps users to reveal these hidden dependencies, prevents misleading interpretations of clusters and analyze the behavior of the embedding model)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
392 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 756 0 R
